// Player character template. Copy the block below into content/player_characters.ron's list.
// The character is then a Warsong Gulch boss for heroes of the other faction (its bosses are
// `played_by: Some(Any)`) and an assist a battle standard summons for heroes of its own faction:
// nothing else to change. Its faction is its race's. Every field and every assist block is
// explained in docs/game/AUTHORING.md ("A player character and its assist") and
// docs/game/assists.md.
(
    id: "my_character",            // its own id, once in the list
    name: "Mycharacter",           // our own name, shown over its head
    race: "orc",                   // an id in races.ron
    class: "warrior",              // an id in classes.ron (any race and class pair the game allows)
    gender: Male,                  // or Female
    // form: Some(Cat),            // optional: a druid shown in Cat, Bear or Moonkin Form
    // looks: Some((skin: 0, face: 0, hair_style: 0, hair_color: 0, facial_hair: 0)),
    //                             // optional: its face and hair (left out: picked each time it shows)
    yell: "For the Horde!",        // yelled as it arrives (as a boss, or assisting)
    death_yell: "Until next time!", // optional: yelled as it dies or as its assist ends
    // What its assist does, as a player reads it. Write the numbers here that the script uses.
    assist: "Charges into the nearest enemy, sends every enemy around it fleeing for 6 sec, then Whirlwinds through them for 6 sec, each spin 3% of its max health.",
    // What it does (left out: its class's default in content/class_assists.ron, and the game's
    // log names it among the characters still on a default). It stays 15 sec unless
    // `seconds: Some(...)` gives another time; what it leaves behind runs out on its own time.
    assist_script: Some((
        arrive: (how: Plain, look_spell: Some(6673)), // Plain, Blink, Stealth or Portal; beside: Some(<targets>) to appear by an enemy
        steps: [
            Move(to: Nearest(1), how: Charge),
            Hit(targets: NearAlly(radius: 10.0), look_spell: Some(5246), effects: [Fear(seconds: 6.0)], wears: [5246]),
            Repeat(every: 1.0, times: 6, steps: [
                Hit(targets: NearAlly(radius: 8.0), damage: true, look_spell: Some(1680)),
            ]),
        ],
        leave: (how: Fade),        // Fade, Vanish, Hearth, RunAway or Dies
    )),
    // What it does after its assist until it leaves (left out: its class's default in
    // content/class_assists.ron): how it moves (Melee, ErraticMelee, Caster, NovaKiteCaster,
    // Healer or LeavesAfterScript) and the spells it loops, each a row in
    // content/assist_spells.ron (none: a melee style only auto attacks). Each cast strikes
    // the script's damaging picks again (docs/game/assists.md, "Its rotation").
    behaviour: Some((style: Melee, rotation: [21553, 1680, 25286])), // Mortal Strike, Whirlwind, Heroic Strike
    gear: Random,                  // its class's PvP looks, or Picked((...)) as in player_characters.ron
)
